eserve simultaneous pattern names\nwith checked aliases. Track private child hypotheses through dependent index\nrefinement and lower calls before inner branch binders close. Hide those\nhypotheses from ordinary proof and instance search. Retain all source typing\nobligations and reject nondecreasing or escaping calls.\n\nTwenty-seven source regressions and an installed CLI test cover indexed\nvector/list zipping, nested payloads, generic parameters, changing accumulators,\npartial applications, universal induction and failure isolation. Local scoped\nrun: 1751 top-level tests pass, zero failed or ignored; Clippy and workspace\ncompilation pass. No kernel changes, new axioms, dependencies or admission path.\nRemote gates repeat before non-forced publication. Related workstream: fln-qb5.","examples":[["examples/native_matrix_recursion.lean",17,7]]}
